6710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116527","id":3937556710,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qsljm","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T23:02:32Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T23:02:32Z","body":"> I'm wondering if we should also include checks for `opengl3_angle`, though it's likely to only be testable on Android XR devices when the [ANGLE rollout](https://developer.android.com/games/develop/vulkan/overview#android-angle-on-vulkan-roadmap) is more advanced.\r\n\r\nI don't think we should check for `opengl3_angle`.\r\n\r\nThat means using an ANGLE that the developer provides. In the context of Android, I think it would be an ANGLE provided by the system, which we'd probably load via EGL, and be totally unaware that we're using ANGLE and not a real OpenGL ES driver.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937556710/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},